 "documentTemplates": [
  {
   "id": 1003001,
   "name": "Start",
   "jsonSchema": {
    "title": "Educational certificate",
    "type": "object",
    "pdfRequired": false,
    "signRequired": false,
    "showNextTaskButton": false,
    "finishBtn": "Continue",
    "forceRedirect": true,
    "properties": {
     "intro": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Welcome",
      "properties": {
       "text": {
        "control": "text.block",
        "htmlBlock": "<div><p>This service issues your educational institution certificate as a digital credential into your wallet. You pay the 10.00 EUR fee by approving it in your wallet — no card forms. We assume you have graduated — congratulations!</p><p style='margin-bottom:4px;'><b>Your journey:</b></p><ul style='margin:6px 0;padding-left:0;list-style:none;'><li style='margin:5px 0;'>1. <a href='/tasks/create/1004/1004001' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;'>Register as a learner</a> — share your ID, enrol, and receive your Learner Profile credential</li><li style='margin:5px 0;'><b>2. Educational certificate</b> — pay the 10.00 EUR fee from your wallet and receive your certificate <span style='color:#0e7c7b;font-weight:600;'>← you are here</span></li><li style='margin:5px 0;'>3. <a href='/tasks/create/1005/1005001' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;'>Apply for a job</a> — share your ID and certificate with CivicWorks Careers</li></ul><p style='margin-bottom:4px;'><b>Before you start, you need:</b></p><ul style='margin:6px 0;padding-left:0;list-style:none;'><li style='margin:4px 0;'>1. The <b>iGrant.io Data Wallet</b> app on your phone — <a href='https://docs.igrant.io/docs/data-wallet-tryitout/' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>download instructions here</a>.</li><li style='margin:4px 0;'>2. A <b>Learner Profile</b> credential in the wallet — <a href='/tasks/create/1004/1004001' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;'>complete step 1 first</a>.</li><li style='margin:4px 0;'>3. A <b>TS12 payment credential</b> in the wallet, account or card type (it pays the fee) — <a href='https://igrant.io/demo/ts12-payment-credential-issuance.html' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>get one here</a>.</li></ul><p>Press Continue to start.</p></div>"
       }
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "jsonSchemaRaw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Educational certificate\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"pdfRequired\": false,\n    \"signRequired\": false,\n    \"showNextTaskButton\": false,\n    \"finishBtn\": \"Continue\",\n    \"forceRedirect\": true,\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"intro\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Welcome\",\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"text\": {\n                    \"control\": \"text.block\",\n                    \"htmlBlock\": \"<div><p>This service issues your educational institution certificate as a digital credential into your wallet. You pay the 10.00 EUR fee by approving it in your wallet \\u2014 no card forms. We assume you have graduated \\u2014 congratulations!</p><p style='margin-bottom:4px;'><b>Your journey:</b></p><ul style='margin:6px 0;padding-left:0;list-style:none;'><li style='margin:5px 0;'>1. <a href='/tasks/create/1004/1004001' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;'>Register as a learner</a> \\u2014 share your ID, enrol, and receive your Learner Profile credential</li><li style='margin:5px 0;'><b>2. Educational certificate</b> \\u2014 pay the 10.00 EUR fee from your wallet and receive your certificate <span style='color:#0e7c7b;font-weight:600;'>\\u2190 you are here</span></li><li style='margin:5px 0;'>3. <a href='/tasks/create/1005/1005001' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;'>Apply for a job</a> \\u2014 share your ID and certificate with CivicWorks Careers</li></ul><p style='margin-bottom:4px;'><b>Before you start, you need:</b></p><ul style='margin:6px 0;padding-left:0;list-style:none;'><li style='margin:4px 0;'>1. The <b>iGrant.io Data Wallet</b> app on your phone \\u2014 <a href='https://docs.igrant.io/docs/data-wallet-tryitout/' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>download instructions here</a>.</li><li style='margin:4px 0;'>2. A <b>Learner Profile</b> credential in the wallet \\u2014 <a href='/tasks/create/1004/1004001' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;'>complete step 1 first</a>.</li><li style='margin:4px 0;'>3. A <b>TS12 payment credential</b> in the wallet, account or card type (it pays the fee) \\u2014 <a href='https://igrant.io/demo/ts12-payment-credential-issuance.html' style='color:#1a56db;text-decoration:underline;' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>get one here</a>.</li></ul><p>Press Continue to start.</p></div>\"\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
   "htmlTemplate": "",
   "accessJsonSchema": {},
   "additionalDataToSign": null,
   "createdAt": "2026-08-26T09:00:00.000Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-08-26T09:00:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": 1003002,
   "name": "Payment",
   "jsonSchema": {
    "title": "Payment",
    "type": "object",
    "pdfRequired": false,
    "signRequired": false,
    "showNextTaskButton": false,
    "finishBtn": "Continue",
    "forceRedirect": true,
    "properties": {
     "summary": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Your certificate (from your Learner Profile)",
      "properties": {
       "institution": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Educational institution",
        "value": "({documents, events, documentData, user}) => { const d = (documents || []).find((x) => x.documentTemplateId === 1003005); const c = d?.data?.share?.wallet?.result?.claims || {}; return c.institution || ''; }",
        "readOnly": true
       },
       "programmeName": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Programme",
        "value": "({documents, events, documentData, user}) => { const d = (documents || []).find((x) => x.documentTemplateId === 1003005); const c = d?.data?.share?.wallet?.result?.claims || {}; return c.programme_name || ''; }",
        "readOnly": true
       },
       "programmeLevel": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Programme level",
        "value": "({documents, events, documentData, user}) => { const d = (documents || []).find((x) => x.documentTemplateId === 1003005); const c = d?.data?.share?.wallet?.result?.claims || {}; return /^(MSc|MA|M\\.|Master)/i.test(String(c.programme_name || '')) ? 'Master' : 'Bachelor'; }",
        "readOnly": true
       },
       "finalOutcome": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Final outcome",
        "readOnly": true,
        "value": "({documents, events, documentData, user}) => 'Passed'"
       }
      }
     },
     "payment": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Payment method",
      "properties": {
       "method": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "How do you want to pay the 10.00 EUR fee?",
        "control": "radio.group",
        "checkRequired": "() => true",
        "items": [
         {
          "id": "account",
          "title": "Pay by account - uses the Payment Account credential in your wallet"
         },
         {
          "id": "card",
          "title": "Pay by card - uses the Payment Card credential in your wallet"
         }
        ]
       }
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "jsonSchemaRaw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Payment\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"pdfRequired\": false,\n    \"signRequired\": false,\n    \"showNextTaskButton\": false,\n    \"finishBtn\": \"Continue\",\n    \"forceRedirect\": true,\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"summary\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Your certificate (from your Learner Profile)\",\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"institution\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"description\": \"Educational institution\",\n                    \"value\": \"({documents, events, documentData, user}) => { const d = (documents || []).find((x) => x.documentTemplateId === 1003005); const c = d?.data?.share?.wallet?.result?.claims || {}; return c.institution || ''; }\",\n                    \"readOnly\": true\n                },\n                \"programmeName\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"description\": \"Programme\",\n                    \"value\": \"({documents, events, documentData, user}) => { const d = (documents || []).find((x) => x.documentTemplateId === 1003005); const c = d?.data?.share?.wallet?.result?.claims || {}; return c.programme_name || ''; }\",\n                    \"readOnly\": true\n                },\n                \"programmeLevel\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"description\": \"Programme level\",\n                    \"value\": \"({documents, events, documentData, user}) => { const d = (documents || []).find((x) => x.documentTemplateId === 1003005); const c = d?.data?.share?.wallet?.result?.claims || {}; return /^(MSc|MA|M\\\\.|Master)/i.test(String(c.programme_name || '')) ? 'Master' : 'Bachelor'; }\",\n                    \"readOnly\": true\n                },\n                \"finalOutcome\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"description\": \"Final outcome\",\n                    \"readOnly\": true,\n                    \"value\": \"({documents, events, documentData, user}) => 'Passed'\"\n                }\n            }\n        },\n        \"payment\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Payment method\",\n            \"properties\": {\n                \"method\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"description\": \"How do you want to pay the 10.00 EUR fee?\",\n                    \"control\": \"radio.group\",\n                    \"checkRequired\": \"() => true\",\n                    \"items\": [\n                        {\n                            \"id\": \"account\",\n                            \"title\": \"Pay by account - uses the Payment Account credential in your wallet\"\n                        },\n                        {\n                            \"id\": \"card\",\n                            \"title\": \"Pay by card - uses the Payment Card credential in your wallet\"\n                        }\n                    ]\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
